   "id": "seg-01",
   "spk": "Alex",
   "en": "Maria says my code is fine. Today I learn to make my own branch. Maria shows me the variable. I point to the value. I look at the branch. This is the main branch. Maria smiles and says, \"How much is this?\" I answer, \"That's too expensive.\" Maria helps me a lot.",
   "tts": "Maria says my code is fine. Today I learn to make my own branch. Maria shows me the variable. I point to the value. I look at the branch. This is the main branch. Maria smiles and says, \"How much is this?\" I answer, \"That's too expensive.\" Maria helps me a lot.",
   "audio_file": "audio/seg-01.mp3",
   "zh": "Maria 说我的代码没问题。今天我学习建立自己的分支。Maria 给我看了变量。我指着值。我看着分支。这是主分支。Maria微笑着说：\"这个多少钱？\"我回答：\"那太贵了。\"Maria 帮了我很多。",
   "hard": [
    {
     "w": "variable",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "变量，用名字保存一个可以使用或改变的值"
    },
    {
