     "def": "这个多少钱？"
    },
    {
     "w": "That's too expensive.",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "那太贵了。"
    },
    {
     "w": "branch",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "分支，从主代码线分出来的独立工作线"
    },
    {
     "w": "main branch",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "主分支，项目默认和最重要的代码线"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "seg-02",
   "spk": "Alex",
   "en": "After work, I buy a new notebook. I ask about the price. I hear, \"Do you have a smaller size?\" then I answer, \"Can I pay by card?\" I look at the string. This is the integer. I see the feature branch. I try to create a branch. I feel good today.",
   "tts": "After work, I buy a new notebook. I ask about the price. I hear, \"Do you have a smaller size?\" then I answer, \"Can I pay by card?\" I look at the string. This is the integer. I see the feature branch. I try to create a branch. I feel good today.",
   "audio_file": "audio/seg-02.mp3",
   "zh": "下班后，我买了一个新笔记本。我询问了价格。我听到：\"你们有小一点的尺码吗？\"然后我回答：\"我可以刷卡吗？\"我看着字符串。这是整数。我看到了功能分支。我试着创建分支。我今天感觉很好。",
   "hard": [
    {
     "w": "string",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "字符串，由文字或字符组成的数据"
    },
    {
     "w": "integer",
