     "def": "你们有小一点的尺码吗？"
    },
    {
     "w": "Can I pay by card?",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "我可以刷卡吗？"
    },
    {
     "w": "feature branch",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "功能分支，专门开发某项功能的分支"
    },
    {
     "w": "create a branch",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "创建分支，建立新的独立工作线"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "seg-03",
   "spk": "Alex",
   "en": "Before I leave, I do one last thing. Maria asks me to switch branches. I point to the branch name. I look at the boolean. This is the data type. Maria smiles and says, \"I'd like this one.\" I answer, \"Could I get a receipt?\" My branch is small, but it is mine.",
   "tts": "Before I leave, I do one last thing. Maria asks me to switch branches. I point to the branch name. I look at the boolean. This is the data type. Maria smiles and says, \"I'd like this one.\" I answer, \"Could I get a receipt?\" My branch is small, but it is mine.",
   "audio_file": "audio/seg-03.mp3",
   "zh": "离开前，我做最后一件事。Maria 让我切换分支。我指着分支名称。我看着布尔值。这是数据类型。Maria微笑着说：\"我想要这个。\"我回答：\"可以给我收据吗？\"我的分支很小，但它是我自己的。",
